<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 1997 beet crop: plantings as per March 17.</title>
<headline>Belgian 1997 beet crop: plantings as per March 17.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian sugar beet plantings as per March 17:</p>
<p>    Sown so far:		393 hectares, or 0.38 pct of total</p>
<p>Planned total area: 102,866 ha</p>
<p>    1996 total area:    103,849 ha</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
